      "page_title": "Auth, Authorization, Multi-Tenancy",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Expiry And Refresh"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Throw inside `onConnect` to reject the handshake",
            "A JWT valid at connect expires while the stream lives on",
            "Schedule a server timer that closes the socket at `exp`",
            "Allow a client message carrying a refreshed token",
            "That message updates the connection context in place"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Tenancy And Origin"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Bake the tenant id into the topic name itself",
            "A filter bug leaks cross-tenant data; a wrong topic returns nothing",
            "WebSocket handshakes are not protected by CORS",
            "Validate the `Origin` header server-side, explicitly",
            "With cookie auth, Origin checking is mandatory, not optional"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Limiting The Blast"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Scope",
            "Cap"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "per connection",
              "subscriptions open"
